NOTICE

This repository is a synthetic, local-first demonstration of an Excel carbon
calculation pipeline.

It does not contain enterprise ledgers, real purchase records, or production
emission factors. Example workbooks under examples/public/ are fictional.

The demonstration factor 1.250000 kgCO2e/kg is a fixture. Unknown files must
not inherit it. Results are not production-eligible and must not be used for
statutory GHG inventories, supplier scoring, or public environmental claims.

This project does not connect to third-party life-cycle databases.
